  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello, i want to report a bug that started happening since one of the updates regarding Physbones and animation.\n\nIt has completely corrupted all my avatar variations of the same body - different outfit booth base avatars. Basically, chest and thighs have a mind of their own at this point and it changes depending on the slider. Though, i have to say i didn't have these issues previously only started around a month ago if i remember correctly.",
